{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the chilling world of <i>Obscura Protocol</i>, a psychological horror game where observation is your only defense. Hired by the mysterious company Obscura, your task is simple: Monitor various locations through live camera feeds and report anomalies before they spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But nothing is ever truly simple. Each location hides its own horrors, whether it's a sleek modern mansion, a desolate mining site, or the eerie remnants of Forsaken City. Flickering lights, distorted figures, objects shifting without reason, every report matters, and missing a single anomaly could be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiple Vision Modes:</strong> Switch between <strong>Night Vision, Thermal Vision,</strong> and Standard View to spot disturbances that would otherwise go unnoticed.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/NV.gif?t=1743772332\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Locations:</strong> Monitor unsettling environments, each with their own secrets and threats.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/Locations.gif?t=1743772332\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> The creeping dread of being watched and the unease of witnessing the inexplicable.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/TV.gif?t=1743772332\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Anomaly Reporting:</strong> Identify, target, and report anomalies before they overwhelm you.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/Report.gif?t=1743772332\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive Until Dawn:</strong> Your shift ends at 6 a.m. if you make it that long.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/extras/Move.gif?t=1743772332\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you prepared to confront what lurks in the shadows? Or will you be another <strong>[REDACTED]</strong> entry in Obscura\u2019s archives?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3466130?t=1743772332","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3466130?t=1743772332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/f7960aaf5547e1d0f084636596c50caa0c72de7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743772332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466130/f7960aaf5547e1d0f084636596c50caa0c72de7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743772332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains psychological horror like scary imagery, events, monsters and corpses."},"demos":[{"appid":3538790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the chilling world of <i>Obscura Protocol</i>, a psychological horror game where observation is your only defense. Hired by the mysterious company Obscura, your task is simple: Monitor various locations through live camera feeds and report anomalies before they spiral out of control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But nothing is ever truly simple. Each location hides its own horrors, whether it's a sleek modern mansion, a desolate mining site, or the eerie remnants of Forsaken City. Flickering lights, distorted figures, objects shifting without reason, every report matters, and missing a single anomaly could be fatal.</p><p class=\"bb